* generic180.lib - generic 180 nm, 1.8 V CMOS models (BSIM3v3, level 49)
*
* PLACEHOLDER for the X-FAB xh018 models, which are not in this repo (see
* AFE/spice/README.md).  The values are typical published 0.18 um numbers,
* not any foundry's data: tox 4.1 nm, Vth ~ +0.40 / -0.42 V, Idsat at
* |Vgs| = |Vds| = 1.8 V about 600 / 260 uA/um, FO4 inverter delay about 85 ps
* (tt, 27 C).  Corners shift Vth and mobility only:
*   tt  nominal        ff / ss  Vth -/+ 50 mV, mobility +/- 8 %
*   fs  fast N, slow P sf  slow N, fast P
* Usage (ngspice and Spectre in "simulator lang=spice"):
*   .lib "models/generic180.lib" tt
* Devices: nch / pch (1.8 V core), nch33 / pch33 (3.3 V thick oxide, tox 7 nm,
* L >= 0.35 um, Vth ~ +0.68 / -0.66 V, Idsat ~ 600 / 290 uA/um at 3.3 V).  Diffusion: pass ad/as/pd/ps (the cells
* use ad = as = W * 0.48 um, pd = ps = 2 * (W + 0.48 um)).

.lib tt
.param dvn=0     dvp=0     mun=1.0  mup=1.0
.inc "generic180_mos.inc"
.endl tt

.lib ff
.param dvn=-0.05 dvp=0.05  mun=1.08 mup=1.08
.inc "generic180_mos.inc"
.endl ff

.lib ss
.param dvn=0.05  dvp=-0.05 mun=0.92 mup=0.92
.inc "generic180_mos.inc"
.endl ss

.lib fs
.param dvn=-0.05 dvp=-0.05 mun=1.08 mup=0.92
.inc "generic180_mos.inc"
.endl fs

.lib sf
.param dvn=0.05  dvp=0.05  mun=0.92 mup=1.08
.inc "generic180_mos.inc"
.endl sf
